- `crates/judge/tests/model_languages.rs`: the shipped-catalogue test used to assert that JavaScript was disabled. It now expects Python and JavaScript enabled, with stub driver files. I marked that assertion change `test-change: IDE-1`, because IDE-1 in `docs/requirements.md` makes Python and JavaScript the launch languages. No test was removed.
